    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c083488c24a51aa41f161f6356cb3524dd25048f111b014700785af6d96adc69",
      "text": "Early transfer to the airport. Flight to Canaima National Park (charter).\n\nCanaima National Park is considered one of the wonders of nature. Across the park, massive mountains rise like islands in a sea of jungle, with sheer cliffs and green-covered plateaus.\n\nMeet hotel representatives, pay park tax, and transfer to the hotel. Check-in and lunch.\n\nIn the afternoon, curiara boat trip (indigenous canoe) along the scenic Canaima lagoon, fed by the Acha, Ukayma, Golondrina, and Vadaima waterfalls. Walk on Anatolia Island. Experience thrilling adventures by passing behind the majestic Sapo Waterfall, between the rock and the water curtain formed by the Carrao River. Return to the hotel for rest and dinner.\n\nMeals: light breakfast, lunch, dinner",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1d-zGdzaSwTuFrgGrsDHYR-aTbeXngYf8",
